Z||000003||Songman||09-13-2000||10:41 PM||||That is typical of chat rooms. I have voice chat room set up on a few of my sites and pretty much it is always me and a few friends. From time to time a new person will stumble in.<P>The one I use is really cool! No downloads, no special stuff to buy... And even for people with 56k it is just like talking on a telephone....and it has a text window for people that don't have mics or just don't want to talk...<P>Cliff, if you are interested in maybe trying this kind of chat here e-mail me and I'll send you the code. Or if anyone wants to give it a try, come on by <A HREF="http://www.tradinpost.net/voicechat.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.tradinpost.net/voicechat.html</A>  right now (9:35 CST) and say hi. I'm there!||||reg||1
